{#-
  Renders the "## Playbook Steps" section, plus "## State" when the playbook declares
  state machines. Inputs:
    graph        — dict[str, list[str]] outer node → deps, insertion order preserved
    waves        — list[list[str]] resolved outer wave order (parallel members per wave)
    subgraphs    — dict[str, SubgraphNode] outer keys that are subgraph nodes
    inner_waves  — dict[str, list[list[str]]] resolved wave order per subgraph
    steps        — dict[str, Step] every loaded step, keyed by name
    playbook     — the playbook name (for the state command invocations)
    states       — list of state entries from render_playbook._state_entries (may be empty)
  Emits one table row per executable step, dependency order: step name, the steps it
  waits for, its summary and its review gate. A subgraph's own row carries its outer
  dependencies and its `repeat` prose; its inner rows follow, tagged and carrying
  inner-scope deps.
-#}
{%- macro cell(text) -%}
{{ (text | string | replace("\n", " ") | replace("|", "\\|") | trim) if text else "—" }}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro deps_cell(deps) -%}
{% if deps %}{% for dep in deps %}`{{ dep }}`{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% else %}—{% endif %}
{%- endmacro -%}
{%- macro step_row(name, note, deps) -%}
{%- set step = steps.get(name) -%}
| `{{ name }}`{{ note }} | {{ deps_cell(deps) }} | {{ cell(step.summary if step else none) }} | {{ cell(step.review_gate if step else none) }} |
{% endmacro -%}
## Playbook Steps

Execute the steps in the most effective order considering their dependencies.

| Step | Dependencies | Summary | Review gate |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for wave in waves -%}
{% for name in wave -%}
{% if name in subgraphs -%}
| `{{ name }}` *(subgraph)* | {{ deps_cell(subgraphs[name].dependencies) }} | {{ cell(subgraphs[name].repeat) }} | — |
{% for inner in inner_waves[name] -%}
{% for iname in inner -%}
{{ step_row(iname, " *(in %s)*" | format(name), subgraphs[name].graph.get(iname)) -}}
{% endfor -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% else -%}
{{ step_row(name, "", graph.get(name)) -}}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% endfor %}
{%- if states %}
## State

Run state is persisted in artifacts under the run workdir. Only `booping playbook-transition` writes it — never hand-edit an artifact's `status`.

Read the whole run's frontier before starting or resuming:

```
booping playbook-state {{ playbook }} --workdir <run workdir>
```
{% for entry in states %}
### State: {{ entry.name }}

- Referenced by: {{ entry.scopes | join(', ') if entry.scopes else "nothing" }}
- Artifact: `{{ entry.artifact }}` (relative to the run workdir)
- Initial status: `{{ entry.initial }}`
- Advance: `booping playbook-transition {{ playbook }} <to>{% if not entry.is_outer %} --state {{ entry.name }}{% endif %}{% if entry.per_instance %} --instance <slug>{% endif %} --workdir <run workdir>`

| Status | To | When | Gates |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
{% for row in entry.rows -%}
{% if not row.edges -%}
| `{{ row.status }}` | {% if row.terminal %}*(terminal)*{% else %}*(no exit edges)*{% endif %} | — | — |
{% else -%}
{% for edge in row.edges -%}
| `{{ row.status }}` | `{{ edge.to }}` | {{ edge.when or "—" }} | {{ edge.gates | join('; ') if edge.gates else "—" }} |
{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
